  <question type="multichoice">
    <name>
      <text>ALG1_U04_L04_GP_Q03</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p><strong>Question ID:</strong> ALG1_U04_L04_GP_Q03</p><p><strong>MLA Standard:</strong> MLA.A1.FN.1</p><p>A table shows x-values 0, 1, 2 and corresponding f(x)-values 10, 15, 20. Which statement correctly identifies the domain and range?</p><p><strong>Representation support:</strong></p><table class="mla-assessment-table" style="border-collapse:collapse;margin:8px 0;"><tr><th style="border:1px solid #555;padding:5px 10px;">Representation</th><th style="border:1px solid #555;padding:5px 10px;">What to Check</th></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #555;padding:5px 10px;">table</td><td style="border:1px solid #555;padding:5px 10px;">compare input changes with output changes</td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #555;padding:5px 10px;">linear pattern</td><td style="border:1px solid #555;padding:5px 10px;">constant rate of change</td></tr></table>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
    <defaultgrade>1.0000000</defaultgrade>
    <penalty>0.3333333</penalty>
    <hidden>0</hidden>
    <single>true</single>
    <shuffleanswers>true</shuffleanswers>
    <answernumbering>abc</answernumbering>
    <answer fraction="100" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[Domain: (0, 1, 2); Range: (10, 15, 20)]]></text>
      <feedback format="html">
        <text><![CDATA[The domain is the set of inputs, and the range is the set of outputs.]]></text>
      </feedback>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[Domain: (10, 15, 20); Range: (0, 1, 2)]]></text>
      <feedback format="html">
        <text><![CDATA[This reverses the input and output sets. This choice reflects a common error or incomplete step. Recheck the mapped lesson method, compare the representation or equation carefully, and identify where the reasoning changes.]]></text>
      </feedback>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[Domain: (0, 10); Range: (2, 20)]]></text>
      <feedback format="html">
        <text><![CDATA[This only uses the first and last pairs and misses middle values.]]></text>
      </feedback>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[Domain: (0, 1, 2, 10, 15, 20); Range: (0, 1, 2, 10, 15, 20)]]></text>
      <feedback format="html">
        <text><![CDATA[This combines all values instead of separating inputs and outputs.]]></text>
      </feedback>
    </answer>
  </question>
